}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:14:41.496Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"2904000","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2904000/","officialWebsite":"https://thespellbrigade.com/","support":"https://thespellbrigade.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":3,"unit":"GB","display":"3 GB","approximateBytes":3000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 3 GB"},"recommended":null},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"partial","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":true,"coop":true,"onlineCoop":true,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player","Multi-player","Co-op","Online Co-op"]},"genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":60,"description":"Gamepad Recommended"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"2904000","steamName":"The Spell Brigade","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2904000/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:50:03.187623+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Survivors-like with ONLINE CO-OP for 1-4 players. Team up with your wizard friends to slay hordes of dark creatures. Complete team-based objectives, unlock new upgrades and create overpowered spell synergies. Friend nor foe is safe in this friendly fire bullet hell!","detailedDescription":"Roadmap\n\nAbout the Game\n\nThe Spell Brigade is an online co-op Survivors-like for 1-4 players. Team up with your wizard friends to slay hordes of dark creatures. Complete team-based objectives, unlock new upgrades and create overpowered spell synergies. Friend nor foe is safe in this friendly fire bullet heaven!\n\n1-4 PLAYER CO-OP\n\nThe Spell Brigade combines the Survivors-like gameplay you love with good old multiplayer madness. Fight thousands of weird monsters together. Complete random team-based objectives and upgrade spells together. Survive together!\n\n \n\nFRIENDLY FIRE BULLET HEAVEN\n\nTaking on entire armies is risky business, even with your friends at your side! Fighting as a team has many perks, but you will inevitably step on each other’s toes. But fear not! You can use your deaths to your advantage, and use Revive Cores to (literally) blast yourself and your teammates back into action!\n\nMASTER YOUR SPELLS\n\nImprove, augment and infuse your spells with different kinds of elements and upgrades. Combine this with your Enchantments, Quests, Scrolls, and the amount of wizards in your squad, and the potential for pure, unhinged chaos is endless!\n\nJOIN OUR DISCORD\n\nIf you have any bugs to report or feedback to share, want to check in on the dev team or just talk about wizards, you can do all that and more on our awesome Discord! We also post dev content at least once a week, so what are you waiting for?!","aboutGame":"The Spell Brigade is an online co-op Survivors-like for 1-4 players. Team up with your wizard friends to slay hordes of dark creatures. Complete team-based objectives, unlock new upgrades and create overpowered spell synergies. Friend nor foe is safe in this friendly fire bullet heaven!\n\n1-4 PLAYER CO-OP\n\nThe Spell Brigade combines the Survivors-like gameplay you love with good old multiplayer madness. Fight thousands of weird monsters together. Complete random team-based objectives and upgrade spells together. Survive together!\n\n \n\nFRIENDLY FIRE BULLET HEAVEN\n\nTaking on entire armies is risky business, even with your friends at your side! Fighting as a team has many perks, but you will inevitably step on each other’s toes. But fear not! You can use your deaths to your advantage, and use Revive Cores to (literally) blast yourself and your teammates back into action!\n\nMASTER YOUR SPELLS\n\nImprove, augment and infuse your spells with different kinds of elements and upgrades. Combine this with your Enchantments, Quests, Scrolls, and the amount of wizards in your squad, and the potential for pure, unhinged chaos is endless!\n\nJOIN OUR DISCORD\n\nIf you have any bugs to report or feedback to share, want to check in on the dev team or just talk about wizards, you can do all that and more on our awesome Discord! We also post dev content at least once a week, so what are you waiting for?!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904000/ef8f6a434fbdfaa2937ff